    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26213" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφίημι</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφῆκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
				</span></i>
			 and <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
			</span></i> (v. infr.): inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23.171
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφήσουσι</span> is f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.32
			</span></i>: <i>dismiss, disband,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στράτευμα ἐκ τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.2.24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δύναμιν</span> D.l.c.; an
			assembly, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.63.14
			</span></i>,al.</div>
